stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> draft: create()
  draft: draft — Loyiha
  awaiting_signature: awaiting_signature — Imzo kutilmoqda
  submitted: submitted — Yuborildi
  processing: processing — Jarayonda
  completed: completed — Tayyor
  rejected: rejected — Rad etildi
  failed: failed — Texnik xato

  draft --> awaiting_signature: requestSignature() / signAndSubmit()
  awaiting_signature --> draft: qaytarildi
  awaiting_signature --> submitted: ERI imzo + to'lov
  submitted --> processing: idora qabul qildi
  submitted --> rejected
  submitted --> failed: 3 urinish xato
  processing --> completed: javob olindi
  processing --> rejected: idora rad etdi
  processing --> failed: 30 urinishda javob yo'q
  completed --> [*]
  rejected --> [*]: refund
  failed --> [*]: refund

  classDef ok fill:#E7F6EC,stroke:#1E9E58,color:#0F5132
  classDef bad fill:#FDECEC,stroke:#D92D20,color:#912018
  classDef prim fill:#0A5BD8,stroke:#0847AB,color:#ffffff
  class completed ok
  class rejected,failed bad
  class submitted,processing prim
  classDef neutral fill:#F5F8FF,stroke:#0A5BD8,color:#101828
  class draft,awaiting_signature neutral
